# Files/folders Cloudflare should NOT upload as website assets.
# The website itself (HTML, CSS, images, .md twins, sitemap, llms.txt) lives at the
# repo root and is served normally — these are just repo/build files that are not part
# of the site. Excluding .git fixes the "Asset too large" build error (the .git pack
# file exceeds Cloudflare's 25 MiB asset limit).

.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
node_modules
scripts
netlify
netlify.toml
requirements.txt
MIGRATION-CLOUDFLARE.md
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__
